The Ada sources (the .ads and .adb files in src/ and proofs/) and the demo scripts (demo/*.bb) are kept byte-identical to the files the
factory produced and proved, so that their recorded checksums and proofs still match. For that reason they do not
carry per-file licence headers; this NOTICE and LICENSE cover them.

Third-party components, kept separate and under their own licences:

1. libmodbus 3.2.0 (commit a9b025d), https://github.com/stephane/libmodbus
   Directory: test-equipment/libmodbus/
   SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later. Licence text: test-equipment/libmodbus/COPYING.LESSER
   Used unmodified, and only as test equipment: it is linked into the simulated PLC (mb_plc_sim) and the scripted
   test controller (mb_demo_master). It is never part of the gateway. The gateway's programs and proven cores contain
